WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:01.399
BOOM!

00:00:01.399 --> 00:00:07.509
On May 12, 2588, the town of Kangaatsiaq,
Greenland, was destroyed by a devastating

00:00:07.509 --> 00:00:12.780
four-kiloton explosion accompanied by a massive
electromagnetic pulse.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:17.350
The few survivors that made it through the
incident alive described seeing a "pale green

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.109
light" in the area at the time of the explosion.

00:00:20.109 --> 00:00:26.530
Shortly after, a ΩK/A-class scenario (or
"end of death" scenario) began, in which all

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:32.219
multicellular life on Earth began to experience
a regenerative effect regardless of injury

00:00:32.219 --> 00:00:33.219
or illness.

00:00:33.219 --> 00:00:36.540
In other words, nobody could die anymore.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:42.149
This resulted in intense, worldwide panic
in the face of the inexplicable occurrence.

00:00:42.149 --> 00:00:47.350
As the panic mounted, the O5 council of the
SCP Foundation held an emergency meeting in

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:50.100
order to address the possibilities at hand.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:55.350
Meanwhile, civilians began reporting sightings
of a giant, pale white humanoid monster rampaging

00:00:55.350 --> 00:01:01.670
through their cities and communities, wreaking
havoc and violently attacking anyone and anything

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:02.920
in its path.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:07.090
As the situation progressed and worsened,
and the reality of the End-of-Death scenario

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:13.360
began to set in, the SCP Foundation made the
difficult decision to lift its veil of secrecy,

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.549
and reveal itself to the world.

00:01:15.549 --> 00:01:20.870
O5-1 made a statement to the UN regarding
the reality of the worldwide anomaly, advising

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:25.159
citizens to remain calm and await further
instructions.

00:01:25.159 --> 00:01:29.520
Five days after the world learned the truth
about the SCP Foundation, the pale monster

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:34.610
arrived in St. John's, Newfoundland, where
it was met by Mobile Task Force Nu-7 "Hammer

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:38.310
Down" for what they hoped would be a quick
fight and neutralization.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:42.689
Instead, two years of devastating, bloody
combat ensued.

00:01:42.689 --> 00:01:48.909
By July 4, 2590, 90% of the task force personnel
had been killed and regenerated an average

00:01:48.909 --> 00:01:50.510
of five times.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:55.979
At this point, MTF Nu-7 abandoned the city
of St. John, citing "anomalously poor working

00:01:55.979 --> 00:01:57.140
conditions".

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:01.289
After being held in place for two years, the
monster was able to break through the defensive

00:02:01.289 --> 00:02:04.219
line and continue its rampage.

00:02:04.219 --> 00:02:10.360
On October 10, 2590, the SCP Foundation and
the Global Occult Coalition came together

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:16.220
in an act of unprecedented cooperation to
found Project Beluga, dedicated to the goal

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:22.630
of neutralizing the monster, designated SCP-UBU,
and stopping its reign of terror.

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:28.640
But Project Beluga was unable to neutralize
the entity before it reached Columbus, Ohio,

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:31.440
on December 29, 2590.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:37.270
Once it arrived in the city, SCP-UBU began
dedicating its time to a gruesome personal

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:38.270
project.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:41.590
First, it dug a two-kilometer-deep hole in
the city's center.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:47.330
Next, it gathered a total of 2.9 million civilians,
throwing them into the hole.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:52.340
After the hole was full, the entity leaped
into the upper stratosphere over and over

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:55.950
again, stomping into the hole each time.

00:02:55.950 --> 00:03:00.450
When the people inside were pulverized, the
entity destroyed a large fountain, which it

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:04.720
used as a cup, and drank the resulting juices
from the hole.

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:09.670
This entire process took roughly one year,
and when it was finished, the entity appeared

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:13.260
to grow bored with Columbus, and moved to
Lake Erie.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:18.920
Upon reaching Lake Erie, SCP-UBU trudged out
into the water and began assaulting the cargo

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.099
ships docked there.

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:24.220
It began lifting ships up and throwing them
out of the water, some flying high enough

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:26.810
to exit Earth's gravitational pull altogether.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:30.650
Two of the ships were later spotted on the
surface of the Moon.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:38.659
This chaos and destruction continued for years
and years, until June 10, 2670, when SCP-UBU

00:03:38.659 --> 00:03:41.130
was contained at SCP Foundation Site-59.

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:46.450
However, this containment only lasted for
two minutes, at which point the entity escaped

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:51.450
and made its way to New York City, where it
was found howling and attempting to defile

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.360
the Statue of Liberty.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:59.069
Several countries used their nuclear arsenals
to attack SCP-UBU over the course of its rampage,

00:03:59.069 --> 00:04:04.790
until the Schenectady Agreement was signed
on February 10, 2674, cementing an agreement

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:09.459
between NATO powers, the Russian Federation,
the People's Republic of China, and the Global

00:04:09.459 --> 00:04:11.140
Occult Coalition.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:15.680
All signatories agreed that, due to concerns
around the environment, any additional nuclear

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:18.540
strikes against the entity would be prohibited.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:23.729
After the signing was finished, SCP-UBU crashed
the ceremony, grabbing several lengths of

00:04:23.729 --> 00:04:30.020
rebar and fifteen foreign dignitaries, which
it used to construct itself a bead necklace.

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:35.509
The next notable incident occurred when SCP-UBU
showed up at Site-19, interrupting a round

00:04:35.509 --> 00:04:41.530
of testing with SCP-AFF - A woman capable
of turning matter into stone by speaking to

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.530
it.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:47.210
SCP-UBU broke through the ceiling, crushing
AFF beneath its weight.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:53.310
SCP-682, which was also present, approached
the entity curiously, and SCP-UBU responded

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:58.610
by angrily defecating, and shouting at SCP-682
in gibberish.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:04.759
SCP-682 seemed to understand this vocalization,
and attacked SCP-UBU, demanding that it take

00:05:04.759 --> 00:05:06.460
back the insult.

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:13.199
At this point, SCP-UBU slapped 682's cheek,
causing 682 to let out a horrific scream.

00:05:13.199 --> 00:05:17.750
The slap left behind a glowing green mark,
which spread over the entirety of 682's body

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:22.720
before breaking the bonds of its cells all
at once, dissolving the reptile into a pool

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.699
of toxic fluid.

00:05:24.699 --> 00:05:29.100
SCP-UBU then spent five minutes bathing in
this fluid while giggling.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:34.600
After finishing its bath, devouring the reconstituted
SCP-AFF, and screaming into the microphone

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:42.530
for twenty minutes, SCP-UBU broke into Armed
Containment Area-179 and swallowed SCP-2317

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.030
whole.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:52.449
On March 5, 2686, SCP-UBU conducted an assault
on Thaumiel Class SCP-2000, rendering it "neutralized."

00:05:52.449 --> 00:05:57.220
Again, years of hell passed as Project Beluga
struggled to come up with new methods that

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:59.250
had not already been exhausted.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:03.850
Meanwhile, civilians did their best to find
ways to cope with the state of the world.

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:10.230
On March 25, 2750, former film star Nash De
Groot published "the Zonk Manifesto," a book

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:15.280
based around a simple principle: Life on Earth
was no longer worth living consciously, and

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:19.979
the only way forward was to enter an eternal
coma through the combination of chemicals

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:21.910
and guided meditation.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:25.940
This kickstarted the social movement, "The
International Zonk."

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:33.560
On June 24, 2790, Project Beluga forces managed
to drive SCP-UBU into the Bay of Bengal, where

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:37.599
it remained for three years, causing very
little trouble aside from underwater seismic

00:06:37.599 --> 00:06:38.599
events.

00:06:38.599 --> 00:06:43.070
Meanwhile, the International Zonk continued
to grow, and one mass of adherents known as

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:47.010
Cuddletopia reached its goal of five million
residents.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:55.550
On July 10, 2793, SCP-UBU flung SCP-3000 out
of the ocean, leaving it beached on the soil

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:56.860
of India.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:59.180
Several cities were destroyed in this process.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:03.640
The entity then spent a week pointing and
laughing at the beached sea monster, before

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:08.199
grabbing it by the tip of its tail and beginning
to drag it across Asia.

00:07:08.199 --> 00:07:14.620
SCP-UBU continued carving a path through Asia,
the wriggling SCP-3000 in tow, until it reached

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.810
the Bering Strait.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:20.789
Then, it began to cross the Strait into Alaska,
returning to North American territory once

00:07:20.789 --> 00:07:21.789
more.

00:07:21.789 --> 00:07:27.250
But it didn't stop there, instead advancing
toward South America until it, and SCP-3000,

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:31.910
arrived on the eastern coast of Brazil on
August 29, 2793.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:37.729
There, it dragged its unfortunate charge back
into the ocean once more, disappearing from

00:07:37.729 --> 00:07:38.729
sight.

00:07:38.729 --> 00:07:45.879
On August 30, 2793, SCP-169, or The Leviathan,
emerged from the depths of the ocean.

00:07:45.879 --> 00:07:50.970
There are some reports that SCP-3000 had been
"tied around its neck" but these have not

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:52.240
been confirmed.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:57.800
The Leviathan and SCP-UBU then entered into
a lengthy battle which carried on for several

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.360
hundred years.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:03.849
After so much time had passed that witnesses
could scarcely remember a time when it wasn't

00:08:03.849 --> 00:08:09.930
happening, the fight between SCP-UBU and SCP-169
came to a halt.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:17.960
Much as it had with SCP-682, SCP-UBU slapped
SCP-169 across the face with such force that

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:23.240
its cell bonds dissolved, and it melted into
a puddle of fluid, which was lost beneath

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:25.120
the ocean waves.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:28.940
SCP-169 was reclassified "neutralized."

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:34.440
December 11, 3020 marked the start of a ten-year
period of inactivity for SCP-UBU.

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:38.349
Ordinarily, one would expect this to come
with a sense of relief.

00:08:38.349 --> 00:08:43.870
However, even in spite of the global immortality,
the collateral damage from SCP-UBU's centuries

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:49.630
of carnage had rendered the surface of the
earth uninhabitable, with all land now underwater.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:54.529
The remains of human civilization persist
on a single archipelago of floating cities

00:08:54.529 --> 00:08:57.000
constructed from ships and debris.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:01.760
Meanwhile, the International Zonk movement
has persisted, gaining more and more traction

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:06.640
and popularity as conscious life became less
and less bearable.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:11.500
An enormous floating Zonk Pile, consisting
of International Zonk followers using anomalous

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:15.240
methods to achieve "the perfect Zonk," began
to form.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:18.450
Eventually, this pile earned the nickname
"New Zonkland."

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:24.850
By May 28, 3028, the Archipelago was abandoned,
and the 140 remaining conscious humans retreated

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:28.050
to the SCP Foundations SCPS Naismith.

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:34.050
There, they lived in relative safety for several
months, until SCP-UBU was spotted in the water

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:38.630
off the port bow of the Naismith on January
14, 3030.

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:44.200
It emitted several sounds that witnesses described
as "mocking," before swimming off toward New

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.200
Zonkland.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:49.310
In response to this reappearance after ten
years of inactivity, the O5 Council called

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:50.740
an emergency meeting.

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.780
The transcript for this meeting reads as follows:

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:56.519
O5-11: We haven't exhausted all of our anomalous
options for neutralizing UBU.

00:09:56.519 --> 00:09:57.519
Where's the Corncrake?

00:09:57.519 --> 00:09:59.339
O5-2: We've been over this, Laurence!

00:09:59.339 --> 00:10:01.650
Throwing the Corncrake in this mess is only
going to -

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:04.800
O5-4: It's anchored 57 klicks due southeast.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.630
O5-2: …Four, why the hell did you tell him
that?

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:08.630
O5-11: Well, friends?

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:14.040
It seems the Omega-K has had us up and about
so long that our personalities have run out

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:15.970
of the fuel we were given from birth.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:20.399
In all likelihood, we'd see better professionalism
and teamwork in New Zonkland.

00:10:20.399 --> 00:10:24.070
O5-2: …as a matter of fact, that's a good
segue into what I was about to propose.

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:28.100
O5-11: Then frankly, I hope you find the nicest,
cleanest spots in the mass grave.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.460
O5-1: Where are you going?!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:32.300
O5-11: That depends, which way is southeast?"

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:38.139
At this point, O5-11 left the room, presumably
to track down the Corncrake, leaving the remains

00:10:38.139 --> 00:10:43.029
of the O5 council there, and leaving the remains
of Project Beluga with the question of how

00:10:43.029 --> 00:10:45.730
to handle SCP-UBU.

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:51.680
According to its official SCP Foundation file,
SCP-UBU is an extremely violent and hostile

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:57.930
humanoid entity of unknown origin, which appeared
in Greenland on May 12, 2588.

00:10:57.930 --> 00:11:02.860
It displays anomalous physical strength and
speed, as well as reality-bending capabilities

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:08.709
and the emission of regenerative lambda waves
linked to an ongoing End-Of-Death Scenario.

00:11:08.709 --> 00:11:13.730
The appearance of SCP-UBU, and the start of
the End-of-Death scenario, coincided with

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.540
several additional phenomena.

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:20.950
There was a mass loss of function for all
the objects operated by the Three Moons Initiative.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:27.950
The Three Moons Initiative was an extradimensional
human organization based in SCP-2922-C, or

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:30.279
the afterlife known as Corbenic.

00:11:30.279 --> 00:11:34.820
This organization was founded 14,000 years
ago with the purpose of establishing a human

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:41.399
colony in the afterlife, and has long maintained
a peace treaty with the SCP Foundation.

00:11:41.399 --> 00:11:46.770
SCP-2922, a method of communication that allowed
a human mind to make calls to any pre-established

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:49.580
phone number, ceased all functions.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:54.389
Next, the extradimensional space known as
the Wanderer's Library, a magical archive

00:11:54.389 --> 00:11:58.850
of all of the knowledge from all known worlds,
and every book that has ever been written,

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:04.170
will be written, and several that have not
and will not exist, was severed from Earth.

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:08.500
When the SCP Foundation pressed the Serpent's
Hand for answers, a representative answered

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:14.120
that "irreconcilable security concerns" regarding
Earth had come up, and forced them to make

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.120
this decision.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:19.990
A representative of Marshall, Carter, and
Dark, Ltd somehow gained access to the personal

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:24.600
contact information of the O5 Council's members,
and used this information to reach out to

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.500
them with a business off.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:31.769
The company is ordinarily on unfriendly terms
with the SCP Foundation due to their conflicting

00:12:31.769 --> 00:12:37.060
interests, namely Marshall, Carter, and Dark's
interests in acquiring and selling anomalous

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:41.060
items, entities, and experiences to the highest
bidder.

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:45.839
However, in this case, the company's representative
approached O5 council members with a mixture

00:12:45.839 --> 00:12:51.300
of politeness and desperation, begging the
SCP Foundation to purchase large amounts of

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:52.820
the company's stock.

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:57.810
The forest known as SCP-4000 lost all of its
anomalous properties all at once.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:02.990
Investigation revealed only a small parchment
note in the area's entryway, which read: "Good

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:03.990
luck!"

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:07.779
One of the most perplexing, and disconcerting
phenomena that occurred concurrently with

00:13:07.779 --> 00:13:14.050
SCP-UBU's first appearance was what happened
to SCP-3008, the Infinite Ikea.

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:18.589
Though this sort of thing should have been
impossible, the Infinite Ikea was anomalously

00:13:18.589 --> 00:13:23.889
purchased by some unknown entity, the Ikea
branding was stricken from the building, and

00:13:23.889 --> 00:13:27.000
it was converted into an emergency shelter.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:31.949
All of these occurrences combined to serve
as a warning: something big is coming.

00:13:31.949 --> 00:13:34.920
And, indeed, it was.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.370
SCP-UBU.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:40.860
It appears to be impervious to most forms
of damage, including blunt force trauma, heavy-caliber

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:46.740
machine gun fire, temperatures of up to 1,600
Kelvin, artillery fire, and direct energy

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:49.110
discharge from other anomalies.

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:54.680
It did express some discomfort when exposed
to several simultaneous direct nuclear strikes,

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.790
but was not affected beyond that.

00:13:56.790 --> 00:14:03.630
The only recorded instance of lasting damage
to SCP-UBU was on August 14, 2784, in which

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:08.810
the entity bit its left thumb, seemingly for
no reason other than curiosity.

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:13.800
After biting its thumb, the entity screamed
for seven days straight, then entered a month-long

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:14.800
crying fit.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:18.760
Thirty years and fourteen days later, the
thumb had completely healed.

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:22.149
SCP-UBU stands at a height of 4.3 meters.

00:14:22.149 --> 00:14:26.630
While an exact measure of its weight is unknown,
attempts at measurement during its brief time

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:32.250
in containment showed that its weight is at
least 15,399 kilograms.

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:37.570
Its exact anatomical composition is unknown,
but a superficial examination of the entity

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:42.279
indicates that its body shape resembles that
of a large, androgynous humanoid covered in

00:14:42.279 --> 00:14:47.450
hairless white skin similar in texture to
that of a dolphin or small whale.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:52.949
The entity has no eyes, ears, or nostrils,
but seems to still possess the ability to

00:14:52.949 --> 00:14:55.009
see, hear, and smell.

00:14:55.009 --> 00:15:00.610
Its only visible sensory organ, aside from
its skin, is a 0.5-meter-wide mouth, humanoid

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:04.200
in nature, with a prehensile tongue of unknown
length.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:09.620
On its lower body, it has no apparent features
aside from a cloaca that it uses to dispose

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:10.620
of waste.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:16.000
SCP-UBU is prone to vocalizations, mainly
screaming, laughing, and babbling, but it

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:21.160
does not appear to understand speech in any
known language, nor does it seem to be attempting

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:24.030
to communicate with anyone it encounters.

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:28.630
Its primary interest appears to be destruction,
and causing as much of it as possible.

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:33.069
It will attack anything that it can get its
hands on, but seems to show a particular preference

00:15:33.069 --> 00:15:38.649
for attacking and consuming human beings in
large, populous areas such as cities.

00:15:38.649 --> 00:15:43.450
Its demeanor is both sadistic and childlike,
and it has been seen playing with its victims

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.480
for hours before moving on to a new target.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:51.800
Due to the regenerative effect present in
SCP-UBU's vicinity, it is incapable of causing

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:56.529
permanent damage to any living thing, and
seems to have no greater motivation beyond

00:15:56.529 --> 00:15:58.759
causing fear and pain.

00:15:58.759 --> 00:16:04.160
SCP-UBU is classified as Tiamat, meaning that
it cannot be reasonably contained at this

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:07.199
time with the resources that the Foundation
has.

00:16:07.199 --> 00:16:12.699
Therefore, the focus has shifted from containment
to neutralization, which is ongoing via Project

00:16:12.699 --> 00:16:13.800
Beluga.

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:18.490
Any and all non-critical resources will be
funneled into Project Beluga, as neutralization

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:21.870
of SCP-UBU is a top priority.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:26.240
Additional information on neutralization efforts
is restricted, and may only be accessed by

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:28.360
members of Project Beluga.

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:32.620
But in the end, it won’t be Project Beluga
that defeats this monstrous creature.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:37.850
It’ll be the staunch efforts of one extremely
dedicated researcher…

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:44.199
Now check out “The O5 Council Must Die SCP-001
- The Way It Ends - Ouroboros Cycle” and

00:16:44.199 --> 00:16:46.700
“Insane SCP-001 Fight - Gate Guardian VS
Scarlet King!”

